[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん～～～～……素材も手に入ったし、\n今日も実りある１日だったなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm-hmm... Got my materials and everything. Today was another productive day!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ベップと会ってから、もう１年も経ったんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's been a whole year since you came to live with us, Bepp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どう？\u3000ここでの生活は。楽しい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How are you finding life here? Are you happy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん。毎日姉様と一緒にいられて、充実してる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. Every day with you has been fulfilling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。ならよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad to hear that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "色々、仕事を教えてもらって、どう？\n聖戦士としてやっていけそう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, how's the job training going? Feeling confident as a Sacred Knight?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。元から戦うのは得意だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Combat has always been my strong suit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "礼儀作法も、大丈夫",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I've mastered the proper etiquette."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップは地頭、いいからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've always been a quick study, Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いつか、故郷の仇を討つためにも、\n聖戦士として腕を磨くわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll keep honing my skills as a Sacred Knight... so that one day I can avenge my homeland."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ベップは元々、ここから離れた島の出身だった。\n\u3000自然が多く、狩りをして生計を立てていたという）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Bepp was born on a distant island. A place where people lived off the land, surviving through hunting.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ただある時……正体不明の「身体が赤く光る魔物」が\n\u3000現れ、\u3000故郷の村が襲われてしまった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But then... a mysterious 'red-glowing monster' appeared and attacked her village.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（その後、偶然島を訪れたアウグストさんに保護され\n\u3000行動を共にするようになったのだという）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Later, August happened to visit the island and took her in. They traveled together after that.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私はただ一人の生き残りとして、\n家族や、島のみんなの無念を晴らしてみせる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As the sole survivor, I will avenge my family and everyone from the island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この身に代えても！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if it costs me my life!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……その時は、アタシも一緒だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...When that time comes, I'll be right there with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップはもう、一人じゃないんだから。\n師匠も、ヤンネさんも、イェルカも、一緒だからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're not alone anymore, Bepp. You've got Master August, Janne, Jelka, and me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この身に代えて、なんて言わないでね。\n決意のほどは分かるけどさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And please don't talk about sacrificing yourself. I understand how you feel, but still..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も、姉様がどこかへ行く時は、必ず一緒に行くから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And wherever you go, I'll be right there too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、そうね、一緒よベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, that's right. We stick together, Bepp."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おやすみなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good night."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。おやすみー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Night-night!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]